'''Double Team''' (Japanese: '''ダブルチーム''' ''Double Team'') is a pair of [[Pokémon Trainer]]s that debuted in the [[Generation IV]] {{pkmn|games}} and reappear in [[Pokémon Brilliant Diamond and Shining Pearl]]. They are depicted as a pair of male and female {{tc|Ace Trainer}}s.

They use {{OBP|Pokémon|species}} of opposite genders and fight in [[Double Battle]]s.

The first Double Team appears on {{rt|210|Sinnoh}}, but most are found in {{si|Victory Road}} with powerful and well-trained Pokémon. Compared to other Double Battle teams, their AI is very skilled.

They are the [[Generation IV]] version of {{game|FireRed and LeafGreen|s}}'s {{tc|Cool Couple}} and [[Generation VI]] and {{gen|VII}}'s {{tc|Ace Duo}}.

